{"id":"erlangen","lemma":"erlangen","pos":"verb","rank":4865,"glosses":["to achieve, to obtain, to gain"],"ipa":"/ˌɛɐ̯ˈlaŋən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e0/De-erlangen.ogg/De-erlangen.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"erlange","1p":"erlangen","2s":"erlangst","2p":"erlangt","3s":"erlangt","3p":"erlangen"},"preterite":{"1s":"erlangte","1p":"erlangten","2s":"erlangtest","2p":"erlangtet","3s":"erlangte","3p":"erlangten"},"perfect":{"1s":"habe erlangt","1p":"haben erlangt","2s":"hast erlangt","2p":"habt erlangt","3s":"hat erlangt","3p":"haben erlangt"},"future":{"1s":"werde erlangen","1p":"werden erlangen","2s":"wirst erlangen","2p":"werdet erlangen","3s":"wird erlangen","3p":"werden erlangen"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"erlang","2p":"erlangt"}},"subjunctive":{"conditional":{"1s":"würde erlangen","1p":"würden erlangen","2s":"würdest erlangen","2p":"würdet erlangen","3s":"würde erlangen","3p":"würden erlangen"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"erlangt"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich erlangte endlich einen Führerschein.","en":"I finally got a driver's license.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"eventually"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"driver's license"}]},{"text":"Wir erlangten durch das Fenster Zutritt zu dem Haus.","en":"We gained access to the house through the window.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/484880","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"by means of"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"window"},{"g":"access, admittance"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"house, building"}]},{"text":"Ich erlangte einen akademischen Grad im letzten Jahr.","en":"I graduated from university last year.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"academic","l":"akademisch"},{"g":"degree"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"the last one","l":"Letzter"},{"g":"year"}]},{"text":"Man muss hart arbeiten und Glück haben, um Wohlstand zu erlangen.","en":"It takes luck and hard work to achieve wealth.","words":[{"g":"one"},{"g":